# `engines.node` is "22" because that is the Cloud Functions runtime the deploy
# picks from it — it is a deployment target, not a constraint on the machine
# doing the installing. Without this, yarn refuses to install *or run a script*
# in here on a developer box on any other major — which would take `yarn
# typecheck` and `yarn test` at the repo root down with it.
--ignore-engines true
